From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:05:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-sysreg: add gs201 APM
 sysreg

Add the system register block of the gs201 APM domain (0x18020000). Its
SW_CONF registers select the protocol of the APM USIs, such as the UART
that carries Bluetooth on Pixel 7 devices. As on gs101, the APM sysreg
takes no clock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml   | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
index 8a0e8610f..4f0a705e8 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
               - google,gs101-misc-sysreg
               - google,gs101-peric0-sysreg
               - google,gs101-peric1-sysreg
+              - google,gs201-apm-sysreg
               - google,gs201-csis-sysreg
               - google,gs201-hsi2-sysreg
               - google,gs201-peric0-sysreg
